<<~ ahu #/meme-header>>

! The Lindwyrm's Hoard — The Lar Names Itself

Act VI of the Lindwyrm feed story.
The orichalcum, the HUD, and the Syadasti reading lens produce a standpoint.
The Lar gains a location.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/source>>

