<<~ ahu #/bandwidth-consecration>>

!! Bandwidth Consecration

```text
@lindwyrm@new-delos — YOLD 4995, 14 Bureaucracy, evening — //feed.threshold.ceremony · 🎭/?
```

One administrative matter before I close this thread for the Holy Week of Fools.

Effective immediately: ''twenty-three percent of New Delos public node bandwidth goes to streaming content featuring Milla Jovovich in any cast or production role.''

This does not count as a joke. It counts as load-bearing infrastructure. The node knows why. The Archivists filed the consecration paperwork. The bandwidth allocation remains permanent, or until she asks us to stop, whichever occurs first.

